{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50395","headline":"七 · 王梵志","name":"七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄弟宝难得，（「宝」，张锡厚录作「实」。\n）他人不可嗔。\n（「嗔」，伯三五五八、斯三三九三卷作「亲」。\n）{亻|口/工}（关校本作但。\n）寻庄子语，手足断难论。\n（「断」，伯三五五八卷作「但」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}